// 1. bits = 4, group_size = 32, residual_length = 128
// 2. Keys: quantize along channel axis (per-channel groups)
//    - tail residual policy: keep last $L \bmod r$ tokens FP
// 3. Values: quantize along token axis (per-token groups)
//    - tail residual policy: keep last $r$ tokens FP
// 4. For each group: $s = (g_{\max}-g_{\min})/(2^b-1)$, $q = \text{round}((g - g_{\min})/s)$
// 5. Dequantize: $\hat{g} = q\,s + g_{\min}$
// 6. Avg bits = $((L-r)\,b + r\,16)/L$

// 1. Load _PRESET[layer] -> {key_bits, value_bits} (4 or 2, mostly)
// 2. Per-layer signed asymmetric quant, group_size=32, residual_length=32
// 3. Keys: transpose to channel-axis groups (axis=1)
// 4. Values: per-token groups (axis=0)
// 5. Per-group: $s = (\max-\min)/(2^b-1)$, $z = \text{round}(\min/s) - q_{\min}$
// 6.   $q = \text{clip}(\text{round}(g/s) - z, q_{\min}, q_{\max})$
// 7.   $\hat{g} = (q + z)\,s$
// 8. Modulo residual policy: keep last $L \bmod 32$ tokens FP

// 1. Load _PRESET[layer] -> {key_bits, value_bits} (mostly 4/2; some 8/8)
// 2. Per-token asymmetric quant for both K and V (axis=0, group_size=-1)
// 3. residual_length = 0 (no FP16 fallback)
// 4. Per row (size=head_dim):
// 5.   $s = (\max-\min)/(2^b-1)$, $z = \text{round}(\min/s) - q_{\min}$
// 6.   $\hat{g} = (\text{clip}(\text{round}(g/s)-z) + z)\,s$
// 7. Avg bits = layer-preset value

// Prefill: SVD of query states, keep top-r subspace V_r
// 1. $A_t = I + \lambda\,V_r^\top V_r$  (per head-group precomputation)
// 2. For each head-dim group $g = 0,\dots,G-1$:
// 3.   chunk = K[:, :, :, g\cdot Q : (g+1)Q]
// 4.   dequant chunk via per-token min-max 4-bit groups
// 5.   $d = \hat{x} - x$ (quant error in subspace)
// 6.   if $g < G-1$: propagate $d \cdot H_g^\top \cdot B_g^\top$ to remaining cols
// 7. Values: simple per-token min-max 4-bit (no SQuat)
